  "observation": "All ordinary decoder instructions and function positions are identical. Clang14 changes 28 existing table references by +32 bytes; Clang18 changes one by +36 bytes. The new local 24-byte ModR/M displacement-length table was the one new named constant not assigned to the isolated plan section.",
